msgid "Took the pairings of round %{round} and every later round off the public page."
msgstr "Paringen van ronde %{round} en elke latere ronde van de publieke pagina gehaald."

#: lib/pairings_engine_web/live/audit_live.ex:1365
#, elixir-autogen, elixir-format
